        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage F-Series, Flair Door Lever Set With Traditional Camelot Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe elegantly detailed Flair Lever with the Camelot Rose will add beauty and sophistication throughout your home. The arched rose is reminiscent of the old world but not overly antiquated. This leverset is a great way to add classic elegance to any home. It fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\". It is adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" door thicknesses. Available in bright brass or antique brass in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. This Schlage made leverset is perfect for both traditional and contemporary styles homes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWhen you install Schlage lever, you safeguard your home and family as well as your peace of mind. Schlage door levers are resistant to tarnishing, discoloration and corrosion.  Plus, the wide variety of finishes may make your decision tough--just like this lever.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Flair Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>One piece lever for better security and appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2 series 4000 grade 2 keyed entry function.</li>\r\n<li>Pressure-cast zinc tubular lock housing.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime mechanical warranty on residential applications.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Schlage F-Series Flair Door Lever Camelot Collection:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height:  4-5/32\" (4.15\")</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width:  2-27/32\" (2.84\")</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Backset for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\" thick doors</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate: 1\" x 2-1/4\" Round Corner (1/4\" radius corners)</li>\r\n<li>Housing Diameter: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Throw: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate: 1-5/8\" x 2-1/4\" Round Corner Full Lip Strike Plate</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> For use as a pull or to match trim on one side of the door. It does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latches but does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. The lock is activated by a push button in the center of the lever while turning the inside lever releases the lock. It can be opened from the outside with a small circular tool.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry (Keyed Lock):</b> Use when a handle operated by a lock is needed. Unlocked by a key from the outside when locked by inside turn button.  Inside always unlocked. </li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li>\r\nThe <b>Single Dummy Levers are Handed.</b> <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>. All other Flair Lever functions are Non-Handed.\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Flair Lever With Camelot Rose, Schlage F-FLA-CAM",
                "description": "Schlage Flair Lever With Camelot Rose F-FLA-CAM - The elegantly detailed Flair Lever with the Camelot Rose will add beauty and sophistication throughout your home. The arched rose is reminiscent of the old world but not overly antiquated. This leverset is a great way to add classic elegance to any home. It fits standard door cutouts and has an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. It is adjustable for 1-3/8 inches up to 1-3/4 inches door thicknesses. Available in bright brass or antique brass in dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry functions. This Schlage made leverset is perfect for both traditional and contemporary styles homes.",
                "keywords": "SCH-Flair-Levers, Schlage f series Flair door levers, F170FLA, dummy levers, F10FLA, passage levers, f40FLA, privacy lever sets, f51FLA, keyed entry lever locksets, schlage f-series door levers, Schlage door hardware Flair Levers, Flair schlage levers, scroll door levers, SCH-F-FLA-CAM, Schlage Camelot collections, schlage Camelot rose, schlage F FLA CAM, Traditional door levers,"
